{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "c65c692e8037224a8a19f8dcc30a583ab7bbb53cc8ceb1aa0cf9f17df51e9e08", "ja": "私たちはアイドル！", "zh": "我们是偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c47e176ff40fef9a5a498db8f8329bf8217b97a3a87ba9689f70d7bb2c9a36bc", "ja": "公演を大成功に終えた『乙女ストーム！』は\n打ち上げに遊園地へ。アトラクションを思う\n存分楽しんだ帰り道、翼がプロデューサーに\nお礼をしようと提案。その中身は『ライブ』\nという、アイドルらしいものだった！", "zh": "『少女风暴！』的公演成功划下句点，一行人\n来到游乐园举行庆功宴。在尽情享受游乐设施\n之后，回家路上，翼提议要答谢制作人，\n而内容正是充满偶像风格的『演唱会』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a5ae40fde7c1d90fbfb7dc23831f5c89053ec1464079dea2aa90089207292276", "ja": "（乙女ストーム！のライブは大成功で幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（『少女风暴！』的演唱会圆满落幕了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "638c7867b2428a35157f51295424ff2172853c5875c5a55fdaed1478921c832e", "ja": "（今日は未来達を連れて、ご褒美に遊園地へと\nやってきた。思いっきり楽しんでもらおう！）", "zh": "（今天为了奖励未来她们，把大家带到\n游乐园来了，希望她们尽情玩乐一番！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "f6eaf7480141afba87cdbb481117e24f3aae4ca309c04f0a72897eacd4ee21e2", "ja": "わあっ♪　乗り物、たっくさんありますね～♪\n杏奈、どれに乗りたい？", "zh": "哇♪有好多游乐设施喔～♪\n杏奈，你想搭哪一个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6b19bace116edb369235a0a4a8af309b2e911602e8ffee89c13503d5ecc5019", "ja": "えと……。杏奈、最近……レースゲームに、\nハマってる、から……カート……乗りたい……な。", "zh": "唔……杏奈最近……迷上了赛车游戏，\n所以……想搭……卡丁车……呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6e8f83428b053a08b06d7c77d6c089fc2d65613e1648e5062d221847a84f671c", "ja": "いいね、カート！　楽しそ～♪\nみんなで競争しよっか？", "zh": "好棒喔，卡丁车！感觉很有趣～♪\n大家一起来比赛吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "15509a7e7cad146d0104eca6cf7897f73f9405d92822a7e1e589fe58da1beef9", "ja": "ほらほら、\n{$P$}さんも行きましょ～！", "zh": "快点快点，\n{$P$}先生也来玩吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "b37c26d1d176aee3d09c4150d77ec10a7043b5b0d08421273526977a39575e97", "ja": "えっと、アクセル……って、これ？　……きゃあっ！？\nき、急に動いた～！？　ムリ！　運転なんてムリ！", "zh": "呃，油门……是这个？呀啊！？\n突、突然发动了～！？不行！我不会开车！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "b344ef35817ff1655efc859d82de1ae4961707ea8c9ed4d8a2f6629cdbd3ff52", "ja": "レースゲームの基本はアウト・イン・アウト！\nビビッと1位、目指しちゃうよ！", "zh": "赛车游戏的基础就是Out-In-Out！\n要充满活力地以冠军为目标喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "e77c1a526a554018387bba032c35c9ff8e3ca992f09b355b170aec9b58c3bfb3", "ja": "あはは、楽しー♪\n私だって、杏奈に負けないぞー！　ゴーゴー！", "zh": "哈哈，好好玩～♪\n我也不会输给杏奈喔！GO GO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8706fec5cfc146aa595c003fb0663022c24c65646117392aeb91130b58b17496", "ja": "1位は杏奈か。まさか、カートで\nドリフトをするとは……。スゴいな。", "zh": "第一名是杏奈啊。没想到她\n会用卡丁车来甩尾……还真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "5d7e3aabc42ddb49d475c03d1ece0ff60f8ff80c0b95080c05b3e74069810ed3", "ja": "ゲームのマネ、してみたら……、\nできちゃった……。自分でも、ビックリ……です。", "zh": "杏奈只是模仿了电玩……\n就做到了……自己也……吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "13a9a7d183b17b3367e4bef65c64243f289ff22a79d649dfb9f0e5900f6c010c", "ja": "それから……百合子は、大丈夫か？\nずいぶん、恐る恐る運転してたみたいだけど。", "zh": "接下来……百合子还好吗？\n你看起来开得战战兢兢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "e71da59b0aa9b4d7ef8b8f25930f27813afbff41a6da4812805340ae65bb23b2", "ja": "私、運転免許を取ることはあきらめました……！\n車は、人類が扱うには早すぎる機械なのでは！？", "zh": "我放弃考驾照了……！\n人类要驾驭汽车这种机械还太早了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a08f8bbcf9cb974efc1b997e8610dd577f902f2d4de36bb38864094e65fbb430", "ja": "カートくらいで人類までいかなくても……。\nさて、次はどのアトラクションにする？", "zh": "就只是卡丁车而已，也不用说到人类层面吧……\n好了，接下来要玩哪种设施？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0cbda5a5a1876f240c76757e6e24729d6d2e26c4d93bd276a2613f0a7631407b", "ja": "次は、観覧車乗りましょ～！　\nわたし達、6人だから、3人ずつにわかれよう？", "zh": "接下来去搭摩天轮吧～！\n因为我们有六个人，就分成三个三个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0522c16d299dad8e8738f10f4992637fee3d2ff03dba45148b40270d2e40e2d4", "ja": "わたしと瑞希ちゃんと{$P$}さん。\nで、未来と杏奈と百合子ちゃん！　決まり♪", "zh": "我和瑞希和{$P$}先生一组，\n然后未来、杏奈和百合子一组！决定了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "bab3b4b6c23018dc573f60d355372f7d831e91cf3130da18a55b462241a67c7d", "ja": "思ったより高いですが、とてもいい眺めですね。\n……劇場、見えるかな。", "zh": "虽然比想像中高，但视野真好呢。\n……不知道看不看得到剧场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "0feac4873853ba79db69378bd47e58093ee44fb3578df564c3f4a159f0110d93", "ja": "……あ。北上さんが空を飛んでいます。", "zh": "……啊，北上飞在空中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "164326180e6fd794f68d598edf5efa219eb44607d586e21a896c3df0b9ce7532", "ja": "な、何だって！？　そんなバカな！？", "zh": "你、你说什么！？怎么可能！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2649e5f69352108de4766eb655a559c0a62d24bf9ea2efcc6496cfaed7cb351", "ja": "ジョークです。さすがに、北上さんでも、\n空を飛んだりはしません。……多分。", "zh": "这是笑话。就算是北上，\n也不会飞在空中……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cd3aa923073d4fd907ae82434b5bb91104ab1dbc489a35fb4801a9c448025322", "ja": "そ、そうだよな……。\nまんまと引っかかったよ。", "zh": "说、说得也是啊……\n我完全上当了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "554864893c1435279c841b42ecebc81b30ee2d435e13e36c30db285cd1845473", "ja": "驚いてもらえたようでうれしいです。私は、\n驚かせるのが好きなので。……サプライズ、成功。", "zh": "你似乎吓到了，真开心，\n因为我很喜欢吓人……惊喜成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "7b99a3cc4653cc42a3b4a58fffa513c9936c91e56074bc32ec17229ef0e2ac3d", "ja": "ところで、伊吹さん。\nありがとうございました。", "zh": "话说回来，伊吹，\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4bd2d9b3bde292517068afb989cec72c7438cfae410e40b482db3436b7fd24bf", "ja": "えっ？　急にどうしたの、瑞希ちゃん？", "zh": "咦？瑞希，你怎么突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "9227bea590f30af8fb864fe0b787dfa5ff8647bb6f6ffe9e6f05cf3c2a52f5cc", "ja": "今回の公演が盛り上がったのは、伊吹さんの\nおかげだと思ったので。そのお礼の言葉です。", "zh": "因为我认为这次公演的气氛能够这么热烈，\n是多亏了有伊吹，因此向你道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "dd199faef89b8e21ec0144c7b1708389410fe35dec36ac7a5ccc01d92fa99494", "ja": "伊吹さんが考えた振り付けのダンスは、\nファンのみなさんに、とても好評なようです。", "zh": "伊吹设计的舞蹈动作，\n似乎也大获粉丝的好评。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3338b2380acb94be9e4272863842d25dfeea15366bb8e789b552ddd1c6677ea2", "ja": "ああ。ファンがあのダンスを踊った動画が、\nいくつもアップされている。それも、結構な再生数だ。", "zh": "是啊，粉丝上传了好几支跳那个舞步的影片，\n而且观看次数也相当高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "582767d4555ded3a01d0c2eef25cded24bb53064d4655403086414d763ceb216", "ja": "なので、改めてお礼を言わせてください。\nありがとうございました。", "zh": "所以请让我再次向你道谢，\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4c6a99ec17edda7f745e6f2cac55da9289545a32c6a37515d144243cf8941d8", "ja": "も、も～。そんなに何度も言わなくていいですよ～。\nけど、頑張って良かったかも……えへへ。", "zh": "真、真是的～不用说那么多次啦～\n不过幸好我有努力……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7ae7f6404df17eb1d61221ff1e48102e6bce80dddd0087a3c2e2e3ab713496a2", "ja": "わたし、アイドルになる前は、\n頑張るのって面倒だな～って思ってたんですけど。", "zh": "我在成为偶像之前，\n都觉得努力好麻烦喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e6848cad80a5135ecedef2189897efb587524aa7a4355e61e9f703bf5f8be29c", "ja": "誰かと一緒だと、楽しいこともあるんですね～♪", "zh": "不过和其他人一起努力，也是件开心的事呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "540671b4ff0cd8bfc336737f61d0b7d9672d66ebf98114f7cb967edfd1502bce", "ja": "そうか。……成長したな、翼。", "zh": "是吗……你长大了呢，翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c4d9497abeb28f1aead6c0b6ff222eaf9657de3a65cc3a75a8c2b94140120b3d", "ja": "そうかな？　自分じゃよくわかんないけど……。\n{$P$}さんに、ほめられちゃった♪", "zh": "有吗？我自己感觉不太出来……\n但是被{$P$}先生称赞了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "346b0815469272dbe7a2009272e00a889223b98a0c01afaa455100a4005747ff", "ja": "それじゃ、ほめられるぐらい頑張ったんだから、\nごほうびはビーフステーキでお願いしま～す♪", "zh": "那既然我努力到被夸奖了，\n就请我吃牛排来犒赏我吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "5b1602478631be181cce6b896fe685aa6478eec0f375eca9e9ac65323030ab29", "ja": "では、私はボルシチをお願いします。\n……デザートはコーヒーゼリーがいいな。", "zh": "那么，我要罗宋汤。\n……甜点选咖啡冻好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "2d6b6032b3e5c1ecd782f2b731791b36f9620e464cd41f46347b984095b4d5c3", "ja": "あ、ああ。みんな、よく頑張ったからな！\n帰りに、みんなに好きなものをおごるよ。", "zh": "好、好啊，毕竟大家都很努力呢！\n回家路上就请大家吃想吃的东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3bbcee2c85f0761bf2d19340a01eac4b9342ec959722f717c8bfd1983e2d5888", "ja": "（……財布の中身は大丈夫だったっけ。\nまぁ、なんとかなるだろう！）", "zh": "（……钱包还撑得过去吧？\n算了，总会有办法的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f515f73acad7fe56c8851c31f31022578d177424689f9f83950ff30778f4090", "ja": "あー、おいしかったー♪\n{$P$}さん、ごちそーさまです♪", "zh": "啊──真好吃──♪\n{$P$}先生，谢谢招待──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "5bc80f76d7ae41e3211ef4e32387982941d1915cf35df03bf0b10628519da31c", "ja": "（思ったより高くついたな……今月は節約しないと。\nだが、みんなが喜んでくれたようで何よりだ）", "zh": "（比想像中还贵啊……这个月要省一点了。\n不过大家看来很开心，这才是最重要的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "29b4509735873a193c338195d66a624376f20d3abc788e14d80124238dcd727b", "ja": "さて、あまり遅くならないうちに帰ろうか。\nみんな、駅まで送るぞ！", "zh": "好了，就趁时间还不会太晚的时候回家吧。\n我送大家到车站喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e2d26ef3d89100153626f85a34877e7f055e08cd2d5d072ec80f87132fd568bd", "ja": "あ、ちょっと待って！　ねぇみんな、\n{$P$}さんにお礼しようよ♪", "zh": "啊，等一下！欸，各位，\n我们来答谢{$P$}先生吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1041_026yur", "source_sha256": "1efa55d3d529207d1f1691b5bff9277a596d98aa6e67fbc8149017925c7e4b82", "ja": "お礼？　でも、私達にできることなんて……。", "zh": "答谢？但是我们能做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "695e3b3cfc5e110c21af8e1f00ece3bc196622298258e281ab54aca2088ff6e3", "ja": "百合子ちゃん、わたし達はアイドルだよ？\nこうするに決まってるでしょ～。こしょこしょ……。", "zh": "百合子，我们是偶像喔。\n当然要这样做啰～（窸窸窣窣）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "384d3368cd9ea5c49620a2abb8728a3b2f67aa94014eddc02726a3640c69fec4", "ja": "あっ……それいいね、翼♪", "zh": "啊……这提议真不错呢，翼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "9fb7b6e59fd9906b076b714214c305541ac84310f1169004ec1218640a7b0c21", "ja": "はい。伊吹さん、さすがです。", "zh": "是的，不愧是伊吹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "3541797b5d0fade2c0d27a22604a789ab8188d4f1975914f5a44d2ccd642b755", "ja": "いや、俺に、お礼なんていいから……というか、\nみんな、何か良からぬことを考えてないか？", "zh": "不，不用答谢我了……说起来，\n你们大家是不是在打什么歪主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "07ac54310e8d0375f195aa6ba1b664b8c356037a5eefa1934683c6015c1ab450", "ja": "そんなこと……ないよ……。\nね……百合子さん……。", "zh": "才没有……那回事……\n对不对……百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "b269049894482071ae7b4d556625d5f00b1e7555aa4e5ba63c8b7b5425ca4299", "ja": "ふっふっふ……。{$P$}さん！\n私達はアイドルですよ！", "zh": "哼哼哼……{$P$}先生！\n我们是偶像喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1048_p", "source_sha256": "bcfc884ca7f55db8390534368b066f41c9c7d2d3567af5d4e6d02f122ff174b8", "ja": "うん、さっき翼が言ってたな。\nで、みんな、何をする気なんだ？", "zh": "嗯，刚刚翼也说过了。\n然后呢，你们打算做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1049_014mir", "source_sha256": "f6bfc0306aefde928116004ea4e25c9dcdaf11ce11807aaf6955f163d171f6d5", "ja": "アイドルがやることといえば……ライブです！", "zh": "说到偶像会做的事……就是演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1050_p", "source_sha256": "2ea132b50bc6221dfe82db9f563d2a9c0c0b179528a2c36790cd9c3c03e08eea", "ja": "ライブ……って、ここでか？", "zh": "演唱会……要在这里唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1051_014mir", "source_sha256": "452a4d068cf0b268785b218c7f0e9747ad2f10cbd43251fac04844abf09e537c", "ja": "はい♪　私達の成長、見てくださいっ！\nそれじゃみんな、準備はいい？", "zh": "是的♪请看看我们的成长吧！\n那么，各位准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1052_044miz", "source_sha256": "de7ff7f940fb0654c2351afb1b3b828bb00da6f1210f5ed54f5fc99ebccb32e7", "ja": "はい。いつでもいけます。", "zh": "好了，随时都可以开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1053_024ann", "source_sha256": "0e99ac12aca29e5b7f2c767cb580a0464ba715c1b926d09f0d34a7b162b22de7", "ja": "杏奈も……ビビッと、頑張る……ね。", "zh": "杏奈也会……充满活力地加油……喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1054_026yur", "source_sha256": "1c28da52d7d6fdcd42b51908c256249fad4de9dc21df7fbd70be3c83b9875d54", "ja": "私達が紡いできた軌跡、見ていてください！\nこれまでも、これからも……！", "zh": "请看我们编织的轨迹吧！\n不论过去，或是未来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1055_016tsu", "source_sha256": "12deebbb685409a253852748454b8f203fbfb68f779e7204c372d44cac570e82", "ja": "未来の風、感じさせちゃうから♪", "zh": "我们要让你感受到未来之风♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0009_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_07_1056_014mir", "source_sha256": "9a8b9abf1470d0809c5d55cb5c5bcf207f785f61b83c96fac9bb0092d898179a", "ja": "それじゃあ……！", "zh": "那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
